sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant UI as POS UI
    participant Sale as Sale Use Case
    participant Repo as Transaction Repository
    participant Pay as Payment Orchestrator
    participant Terminal as Terminal Simulator
    participant Processor as Mock Processor

    Operator->>UI: Enter synthetic amount and submit
    UI->>Sale: Execute sale(request, idempotencyKey)
    Sale->>Sale: Validate amount, currency, and request

    alt Invalid request
        Sale-->>UI: Reject with safe validation error
    else Valid request
        Sale->>Repo: Atomically look up or reserve key with request fingerprint
        alt Existing key with same fingerprint
            Repo-->>Sale: Return stored operation and result
            Sale-->>UI: Return existing result without reprocessing
        else Existing key with different fingerprint
            Repo-->>Sale: Report idempotency-key conflict
            Sale-->>UI: Reject key reuse with a different request
        else New operation reserved
            Repo-->>Sale: Confirm key reservation
            Sale->>Repo: Persist CREATED then VALIDATING
            Sale->>Pay: Process validated transaction
            Pay->>Terminal: Check terminal status and capabilities
            Terminal-->>Pay: Ready or unavailable

            alt Terminal unavailable
                Pay->>Repo: Persist FAILED with safe pre-processing reason
                Pay-->>Sale: Return terminal unavailable
            else Terminal ready
                Pay->>Repo: Persist READY then PROCESSING
                Pay->>Processor: Authorize synthetic request with same idempotency key
                alt Definitive response received
                    Processor-->>Pay: Simulated approval or decline
                    Pay->>Repo: Persist definitive outcome and safe processor reference
                    Pay-->>Sale: Return final transaction result
                else Timeout or connection lost
                    Processor--xPay: Outcome cannot be confirmed
                    Pay->>Repo: Persist UNKNOWN_OUTCOME
                    Pay->>Repo: Mark reconciliation required
                    Pay-->>Sale: Return pending confirmation; do not submit a new operation
                end
            end
            Sale-->>UI: Display result, status, and safe reference
        end
    end
